Input: {"question": "What position does Carlos Enciso currently or formerly hold?", "original_source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 0, "end": 90, "text": "Title: The Unwavering Voice of Uruguay: Carlos Enciso's Journey to the Chamber of Deputies"}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 92, "end": 287, "text": "In the heart of Uruguay, a nation renowned for its rich history, vibrant culture, and strong democratic roots, a dedicated politician has been making waves in the country's legislative landscape."}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 288, "end": 505, "text": "Carlos Enciso, a seasoned Uruguayan politician, has earned a reputation as a champion of the people, and his tireless efforts have culminated in his esteemed position as a Member of the Chamber of Deputies of Uruguay."}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 506, "end": 636, "text": "As we delve into the life and career of Carlos Enciso, it becomes evident that his rise to prominence was not a chance occurrence."}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 637, "end": 763, "text": "Rather, it was the result of years of dedication, perseverance, and an unwavering commitment to serving the people of Uruguay."}, "D1S6": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 764, "end": 882, "text": "Born and raised in Uruguay, Carlos Enciso was instilled with a strong sense of social responsibility from a young age."}, "D1S7": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 883, "end": 1023, "text": "His early life was marked by a deep understanding of the country's complex social dynamics, which would later inform his political ideology."}, "D1S8": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1024, "end": 1166, "text": "As he grew older, Enciso became increasingly involved in local politics, volunteering for various community organizations and advocacy groups."}, "D1S9": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1167, "end": 1301, "text": "These formative experiences not only honed his leadership skills but also fostered a profound appreciation for the democratic process."}, "D1S10": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1302, "end": 1415, "text": "Enciso's entry into mainstream politics was marked by his affiliation with a prominent Uruguayan political party."}, "D1S11": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1416, "end": 1550, "text": "Through his party, he began to build a network of like-minded individuals who shared his vision for a more equitable and just society."}, "D1S12": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1551, "end": 1770, "text": "As he navigated the intricacies of party politics, Enciso demonstrated a unique ability to build consensus and forge alliances, skills that would serve him well in his future role as a Member of the Chamber of Deputies."}, "D1S13": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1771, "end": 1890, "text": "The turning point in Enciso's career came when he was elected to represent his constituency in the Chamber of Deputies."}, "D1S14": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1891, "end": 2054, "text": "This milestone achievement was a testament to his tireless campaigning, his ability to connect with voters, and his unwavering commitment to the people of Uruguay."}, "D1S15": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2055, "end": 2193, "text": "As a newly minted Member of the Chamber of Deputies, Enciso was poised to make a meaningful impact on the country's legislative landscape."}, "D1S16": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2194, "end": 2322, "text": "Evidence of Enciso's position as a Member of the Chamber of Deputies can be found in various official records and news articles."}, "D1S17": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2323, "end": 2505, "text": "According to the official website of the Uruguayan Parliament, Carlos Enciso is listed as a sitting Member of the Chamber of Deputies, representing his constituency with distinction."}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 0, "end": 13, "text": "Carlos Enciso"}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 15, "end": 192, "text": "Carlos Enciso is a Uruguayan politician who has made history by becoming the first non-French citizen to hold the position of sub-prefect of Saverne, a French official position."}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 193, "end": 214, "text": "Early Life and Career"}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 216, "end": 282, "text": "Carlos Enciso was born on August 12, 1975, in Montevideo, Uruguay."}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 283, "end": 380, "text": "He studied political science at the University of the Republic, where he earned a degree in 1998."}, "D2S6": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 381, "end": 537, "text": "After completing his studies, Enciso worked as a researcher at the Uruguayan Ministry of Foreign Affairs, focusing on international relations and diplomacy."}, "D2S7": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 538, "end": 556, "text": "Rise to Prominence"}, "D2S8": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 558, "end": 652, "text": "In 2005, Enciso was appointed as a cultural attaché at the Uruguayan Embassy in Paris, France."}, "D2S9": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 653, "end": 797, "text": "During his tenure, he developed strong relationships with French officials and demonstrated a deep understanding of French culture and politics."}, "D2S10": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 798, "end": 917, "text": "His work caught the attention of the French government, which led to his appointment as sub-prefect of Saverne in 2010."}, "D2S11": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 918, "end": 940, "text": "Studies and References"}, "D2S12": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 942, "end": 1205, "text": "A 2009 study published in the Journal of International Relations found that Enciso's appointment as cultural attaché marked a significant shift in Uruguayan-French relations, with Enciso playing a key role in strengthening diplomatic ties between the two nations."}, "D2S13": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1206, "end": 1209, "text": "[1]"}, "D2S14": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1211, "end": 1442, "text": "A 2012 article in Le Monde Diplomatique highlighted Enciso's unique position as a non-French sub-prefect, noting that his appointment was a testament to the French government's commitment to diversity and international cooperation."}, "D2S15": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1443, "end": 1446, "text": "[2]"}, "D2S16": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1448, "end": 1626, "text": "In 2015, Enciso was featured in a profile by the French newspaper Libération, which praised his efforts to promote cultural exchange and understanding between France and Uruguay."}, "D2S17": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1627, "end": 1630, "text": "[3]"}, "D2S18": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1632, "end": 1653, "text": "Tenure as Sub-Prefect"}, "D2S19": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1655, "end": 1758, "text": "As sub-prefect of Saverne, Enciso has worked to promote economic development and tourism in the region."}, "D2S20": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1759, "end": 1862, "text": "He has also been instrumental in fostering greater cooperation between French and Uruguayan businesses."}, "D2S21": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1863, "end": 2041, "text": "In 2018, Enciso launched the Saverne-Uruguay Business Forum, which brought together entrepreneurs and officials from both countries to discuss trade and investment opportunities."}, "D2S22": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2042, "end": 2045, "text": "[4]"}, "D2S23": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2047, "end": 2257, "text": "A 2020 report by the French National Assembly praised Enciso's efforts to promote regional development, noting that his initiatives had led to a significant increase in foreign investment in the Saverne region."}}, "original_cards": [{"doc_id": "d1", "card_id": "d1:c0", "entity": "Carlos Enciso", "scope": "Uruguay", "claim": "Carlos Enciso is a sitting Member of the Chamber of Deputies of Uruguay.", "answer": "Member of the Chamber of Deputies of Uruguay", "quote": "Carlos Enciso, a seasoned Uruguayan politician, has earned a reputation as a champion of the people, and his tireless efforts have culminated in his esteemed position as a Member of the Chamber of Deputies of Uruguay. As we delve into the life and career of Carlos Enciso, it becomes evident that his rise to prominence was not a chance occurrence. Rather, it was the result of years of dedication, perseverance, and an unwavering commitment to serving the people of Uruguay. Born and raised in Uruguay, Carlos Enciso was instilled with a strong sense of social responsibility from a young age. His early life was marked by a deep understanding of the country's complex social dynamics, which would later inform his political ideology. As he grew older, Enciso became increasingly involved in local politics, volunteering for various community organizations and advocacy groups. These formative experiences not only honed his leadership skills but also fostered a profound appreciation for the democratic process. Enciso's entry into mainstream politics was marked by his affiliation with a prominent Uruguayan political party. Through his party, he began to build a network of like-minded individuals who shared his vision for a more equitable and just society. As he navigated the intricacies of party politics, Enciso demonstrated a unique ability to build consensus and forge alliances, skills that would serve him well in his future role as a Member of the Chamber of Deputies. The turning point in Enciso's career came when he was elected to represent his constituency in the Chamber of Deputies. This milestone achievement was a testament to his tireless campaigning, his ability to connect with voters, and his unwavering commitment to the people of Uruguay. As a newly minted Member of the Chamber of Deputies, Enciso was poised to make a meaningful impact on the country's legislative landscape.", "original_document_number": 1}, {"doc_id": "d2", "card_id": "d2:c1", "entity": "Carlos Enciso", "scope": "former position", "claim": "In 2005, Enciso was appointed as a cultural attaché at the Uruguayan Embassy in Paris, France.", "answer": "cultural attaché at the Uruguayan Embassy in Paris", "quote": "In 2005, Enciso was appointed as a cultural attaché at the Uruguayan Embassy in Paris, France.", "original_document_number": 2}, {"doc_id": "d2", "card_id": "d2:c2", "entity": "Carlos Enciso", "scope": "former position", "claim": "After completing his studies, Enciso worked as a researcher at the Uruguayan Ministry of Foreign Affairs, focusing on international relations and diplomacy.", "answer": "researcher at the Uruguayan Ministry of Foreign Affairs", "quote": "After completing his studies, Enciso worked as a researcher at the Uruguayan Ministry of Foreign Affairs, focusing on international relations and diplomacy.", "original_document_number": 2}], "current_answers": ["Member of the Chamber of Deputies of Uruguay", "cultural attaché at the Uruguayan Embassy in Paris", "researcher at the Uruguayan Ministry of Foreign Affairs", "sub-prefect of Saverne"], "candidate_answers": [{"candidate_id": "R0", "answer": "Member of the Chamber of Deputies of Uruguay", "origin": "initial"}, {"candidate_id": "R1", "answer": "cultural attaché at the Uruguayan Embassy in Paris", "origin": "initial"}, {"candidate_id": "R2", "answer": "researcher at the Uruguayan Ministry of Foreign Affairs", "origin": 